{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわるつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙たくさんありがとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にとっても嬉しかったです。⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また楽しみにしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は太陽が出てるのに風が吹いて寒かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいシャンプーを最近買いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう物は本当に悩んでしまう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからベリについてきてもらって、何回もどっちにしよう。って聞きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう事にベリは一緒に選んでくれるから、そういう所はお姉さんらしいです。( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お会計の時も手荷物を持ってくれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉さんらしい所思い出せた～。!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、ベリと歩いてたら｢姉妹ですかー?｣って聞かれて嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもどっちが姉に見えたんだろう。ってベリがきになってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流石に。私妹だといいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日お疲れ様です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も1日がんばるぞ。!⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYQ76ZMR0PD0NJFY7FW6SZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝癖しか。ないしか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなか"}],"source":"archive"}